div class=\"ph-slide__veil\"></div><div class=\"ph-slide__inner ph-wrap\"><p class=\"ph-slide__eyebrow\">Fire Pits</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-slide__title\">Gather<br />around the fire.</h2><p class=\"ph-slide__sub\">Sculptural fire features that turn any evening into an occasion worth lingering for.</p><div class=\"ph-slide__cta\"><a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--brass\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-fire-pits\">Shop Fire Pits</a> <a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--ghost\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living\">All Outdoor</a></div></div></article><article class=\"ph-slide\" data-slide=\"\"><div class=\"ph-slide__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-hero-4);\"></div><div class=\"ph-slide__veil\"></div><div class=\"ph-slide__inner ph-wrap\"><p class=\"ph-slide__eyebrow\">The Game Room</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-slide__title\">Play that<br />lasts a lifetime.</h2><p class=\"ph-slide__sub\">Shuffleboard and ping pong tables built with the same craft as a piece of fine furniture.</p><div class=\"ph-slide__cta\"><a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--brass\" href=\"/collections/indoor-entertaining-shuffleboard-tables\">Shop Shuffleboard</a> <a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--ghost\" href=\"/collections/indoor-entertaining\">All Indoor</a></div></div></article></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-hero__arrow ph-hero__arrow--prev\" data-hero-prev=\"\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">&larr;</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-hero__arrow ph-hero__arrow--next\" data-hero-next=\"\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">&rarr;</button><div class=\"ph-hero__bar ph-wrap\"><span class=\"ph-hero__count\" data-hero-count=\"\">01 <i>/ 04</i></span><div class=\"ph-hero__dots\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-dot is-active\" data-hero-dot=\"\" aria-label=\"Show slide 1\"><span class=\"ph-dot__fill\"></span></button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-dot\" data-hero-dot=\"\" aria-label=\"Show slide 2\"><span class=\"ph-dot__fill\"></span></button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-dot\" data-hero-dot=\"\" aria-label=\"Show slide 3\"><span class=\"ph-dot__fill\"></span></button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-dot\" data-hero-dot=\"\" aria-label=\"Show slide 4\"><span class=\"ph-dot__fill\"></span></button></div><a class=\"ph-scrollcue\" href=\"#ph-manifesto-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id | default: 'main' }}\"> <span class=\"ph-scrollcue__txt\">Scroll</span> <span class=\"ph-scrollcue__line\"></span> </a></div></section><section id=\"ph-manifesto-{{ section.id }}-{{ block.id | default: 'main' }}\" class=\"ph-sec ph-plank ph-manifesto\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-manifesto__inner\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-eyebrow--ink ph-reveal\">Our Promise</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-manifesto__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">Where craftsmanship<br />and <em>connection</em> meet.</h2><span class=\"ph-scribe ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"></span><p class=\"ph-lede ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"3\">We were born from a love of gathering. Every piece is thoughtfully designed to balance beauty with purpose &mdash; furniture that feels as good as it looks, and stands behind that promise year after year.</p></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-hide ph-worlds\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-worlds__head ph-wrap\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-reveal\">Two Worlds, One Standard</p></div><div class=\"ph-split\"><div class=\"ph-panel ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\"><div class=\"ph-panel__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-indoor);\"></div><div class=\"ph-panel__veil\"></div><div class=\"ph-panel__body\"><span class=\"ph-panel__kicker\">01 / Indoor</span><h3 class=\"ph-display ph-panel__title\">Indoor<br />Entertaining</h3><p class=\"ph-panel__txt\">Pool tables, shuffleboard, and ping&nbsp;pong built to anchor a room.</p><span class=\"ph-link\">Explore Indoor <i class=\"ph-arrow\">&rarr;</i></span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/indoor-entertaining\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-panel ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><div class=\"ph-panel__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-outdoor);\"></div><div class=\"ph-panel__veil\"></div><div class=\"ph-panel__body\"><span class=\"ph-panel__kicker\">02 / Outdoor</span><h3 class=\"ph-display ph-panel__title\">Outdoor<br />Living</h3><p class=\"ph-panel__txt\">Collections, fire pits, and seating made for the open air.</p><span class=\"ph-link\">Explore Outdoor <i class=\"ph-arrow\">&rarr;</i></span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living\"></a></div></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-plank ph-signature\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-signature__grid\"><div class=\"ph-signature__media ph-reveal\"><figure class=\"ph-frame ph-frame--ink\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-signature);\" data-parallax=\"0.1\"></div></figure></div><div class=\"ph-signature__copy\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-eyebrow--ink ph-reveal\">Vintage Series</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-signature__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">The&nbsp;Beaumont</h2><p class=\"ph-lede ph-lede--sm ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\">From our Vintage Series &mdash; French‑inspired trestle legs in solid Ash, built as a centerpiece to be handed down, not replaced.</p><ul class=\"ph-spec ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"3\"><li><span>Series</span> Vintage Series</li><li><span>Legs</span> French‑inspired trestle</li><li><span>Material</span> Solid Ash</li></ul><a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--ink ph-reveal\" href=\"/collections/indoor-entertaining-pool-tables\" data-ph-delay=\"4\">Discover Pool Tables</a></div></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-felt ph-coll\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-coll__head\"><div><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-reveal\">Outdoor Collections</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-coll__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">Made for the<br />open air.</h2></div><div class=\"ph-coll__nav ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-navbtn\" data-coll-prev=\"\" aria-label=\"Previous collections\">&larr;</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"ph-navbtn\" data-coll-next=\"\" aria-label=\"Next collections\">&rarr;</button></div></div><div class=\"ph-coll__track\" data-coll-track=\"\"><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-1);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Adeline</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-plank-hide-adeline\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-2);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Nevis</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-plank-hide-nevis\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-3);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Hudson</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-plank-hide-hudson\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-4);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Estero</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-plank-hide-estero\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-5);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Bradenton</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-elements-bradenton\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-6);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Cade</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-elements-cade\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card\"><div class=\"ph-card__img ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-col-7);\"></div><div class=\"ph-card__meta\"><span class=\"ph-card__name\">Carter</span><span class=\"ph-card__cat\">Seating Group</span></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-collections-elements-carter\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-card ph-card--all\"><div class=\"ph-card__all\"><span>View all<br />Collections</span> <i class=\"ph-arrow\">&rarr;</i></div><a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living\"></a></div></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-plank ph-craft\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-eyebrow--ink ph-reveal ph-craft__eyebrow\">The Difference</p><div class=\"ph-craft__grid\"><div class=\"ph-value ph-reveal\"><span class=\"ph-value__mark\"></span><h3 class=\"ph-display ph-value__title\">Design</h3><p class=\"ph-value__txt\">Unique by intention. Forms drawn to be different, never derivative.</p></div><div class=\"ph-value ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\"><span class=\"ph-value__mark\"></span><h3 class=\"ph-display ph-value__title\">Craftsmanship</h3><p class=\"ph-value__txt\">Built to be kept. Honest materials and joinery that earn their keep.</p></div><div class=\"ph-value ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><span class=\"ph-value__mark\"></span><h3 class=\"ph-display ph-value__title\">Functionality</h3><p class=\"ph-value__txt\">Beauty with a purpose. Pieces that live as well as they look.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-hide ph-look\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-look__head\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-reveal\">Lookbook</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-look__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">See it lived in.</h2></div><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-look__grid\"><div class=\"ph-tile ph-tile--a ph-reveal\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-look-1);\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"></div><span class=\"ph-tile__tag\">Outdoor Lookbook</span> <a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/pages/outdoor-lookbook\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-tile ph-tile--b ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-look-2);\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"></div><span class=\"ph-tile__tag\">Indoor Lookbook</span> <a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/pages/indoor-lookbook\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-tile ph-tile--c ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-look-3);\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"></div><span class=\"ph-tile__tag\">Fire Pits</span> <a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-fire-pits\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-tile ph-tile--d ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-look-4);\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"></div><span class=\"ph-tile__tag\">Shuffleboard</span> <a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/indoor-entertaining-shuffleboard-tables\"></a></div><div class=\"ph-tile ph-tile--e ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><div class=\"ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-look-5);\" data-parallax=\"0.06\"></div><span class=\"ph-tile__tag\">Dining Groups</span> <a class=\"ph-cover\" href=\"/collections/outdoor-living-dining-groups\"></a></div></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-dealer\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-dealer__bg ph-img\" style=\"--img: var(--img-dealer);\" data-parallax=\"0.1\"></div><div class=\"ph-dealer__veil\"></div><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-dealer__inner\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-reveal\">Find a Dealer</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-dealer__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">See it in person.</h2><p class=\"ph-lede ph-lede--center ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\">Plank &amp; Hide is sold through a curated network of dealers across the country. Find the showroom nearest you.</p><a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--brass ph-reveal\" href=\"/pages/find-a-dealer\" data-ph-delay=\"3\">Find a Dealer</a></div></section><section class=\"ph-sec ph-plank ph-retail\" data-ph-section=\"\"><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-retail__head\"><p class=\"ph-eyebrow ph-eyebrow--ink ph-reveal\">Where to Buy</p><h2 class=\"ph-display ph-retail__title ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"1\">Trusted and carried by over<br /><span class=\"ph-retail__num\">200</span> retailers worldwide.</h2><p class=\"ph-retail__sub ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\">From neighborhood showrooms to the nation&rsquo;s largest home retailers &mdash; you&rsquo;ll find us wherever fine furniture is sold.</p></div><div class=\"ph-wrap ph-retail__foot ph-reveal\" data-ph-delay=\"2\"><a class=\"ph-btn ph-btn--ink\" href=\"/pages/contact\">Become a Dealer</a></div></section></div><script>\n(function () {\nif (!window.phHomeController) {\nwindow.phHomeController = function(root) {\nif (root.dataset.phReady) return;\nroot.dataset.phReady = 'true';\nvar cleanup = [], controller = new AbortController();\nfunction on(target, type, handler, options) {\ntarget.addEventListener(type, handler, Object.assign({}, options || {}, {signal: controller.signal}));\n}\nroot.phDestroy = function() {\ncontroller.abort();\ncleanup.forEach(function(fn){fn();});\ndelete root.dataset.phReady;\n};\nvar reduce = window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\nvar reveals = root.querySelectorAll(\".ph-reveal, .ph-scribe\");\nreveals.forEach(function(el){\nvar d = el.getAttribute(\"data-ph-delay\");\nif(d) el.style.setProperty(\"--d\", d);\n});\nif(\"IntersectionObserver\" in window && !reduce){\nif (!(window.Shopify && Shopify.designMode)) root.classList.add(\"ph-armed\");\nvar io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\nentries.forEach(function(e){\nif(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add(\"is-in\"); io.unobserve(e.target); }\n});\n}, { threshold:0.16, rootMargin:\"0px 0px -8% 0px\" });\nreveals.forEach(function(el){ io.observe(el); });\ncleanup.push(function(){io.disconnect();});\n} else {\nreveals.forEach(function(el){ el.classList.add(\"is-in\"); });\n}\nvar px = Array.prot